WEBVTT

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:01.819
It is time for conservation to be broad.

00:13:02.277 --> 00:13:06.824
Broad enough not just to include
a species in trouble,

00:13:06.824 --> 00:13:10.619
but our land and our cultures,

00:13:10.619 --> 00:13:14.706
our innovation, our story, us.

00:13:15.541 --> 00:13:19.461
Who we were, who we are
and who we want to be.

00:13:19.878 --> 00:13:21.046
Thank you.

00:13:21.088 --> 00:13:27.219
(Applause)